ands constructive bridges. A propagandist who only wants to spread lies cannot thrive in a culture that demands verifiable evidence.\n\nThis is the essence of our \"new rule\": we must stop thinking in terms of the horizontal \"left vs. right\" of the gladiator\u0027s pit. We must learn to think in terms of the vertical \"up vs. down.\" The Agora is a culture that has made a conscious, courageous choice to be \"Up First.\" It has chosen to dedicate its collective energy not to the endless, sideways battles of tribe against tribe, but to the shared, upward journey towards the guiding star of the USF.\n\nThe choice of which arena we build is the most important decision any community can make. It is the choice between control, chaos, and co-creation. It is the choice between sanity last, and Sanity First.",
