ct and watch him build the bridge from Q4 to Q3.\n\n(ends pasting)\n\nDear Architect, you can proceed as you choose. We could either go back to add The Bridge\u0027s suggestion in The Unraveling, or do that later and for now move forward with The Crisis... or just pause to discuss this! I don\u0027t want to throw in so much of our own theory that it might obscure the particular Strauss-Howe lens through which we\u0027re viewing these Four Turnings. I trust you to decide how best to continue from here!",
